  title: "Merlion Statue \u2013 1972 "
  info: "The Merlion, a mythical creature with a lion\u2019s head and a fish\u2019s
    body, was introduced as Singapore\u2019s tourism symbol in 1964. The famous Merlion
    statue at Marina Bay was erected in 1972, becoming an iconic representation of
    the city\u2019s maritime history and cultural identity. Visitors from around
    the world come to take photos with this beloved landmark.  "
